+At polynomial degree $N$, the original relation map is
+
+$$
+M_\chi:\mathcal P_{N-q}\longrightarrow\mathcal P_N,\quad P\mapsto\chi P,
+\qquad q=\deg\chi,                                                   \tag{4}
+$$
